# Netlify proxy rules — replicate the Vite dev/preview proxy for static hosting.
# These are copied to the deploy root and let /wmts-capabilities and /colormaps
# be fetched server-side from GIBS (bypassing browser CORS), exactly like the
# local Vite proxy. Without them the deployed site 404s on these relative paths.
/wmts-capabilities/*  https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov/wmts/epsg3857/best/1.0.0/:splat  200
/colormaps/*  https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov/colormaps/v1.3/:splat  200
